<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron to export asphalt to Singapore.</title>
<headline>Petron to export asphalt to Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petron Corp said on Monday it has entered into a one-year agreement to export $4.5 million worth of asphalt to the Singapore Petroleum Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The Philippine's biggest oil refiner said the contract signed on Monday involved about 50,000 tonnes of asphalt.</p>
<p>Petron said there is a growing demand for asphalt in the region particularly from China.</p>
<p>It said the company has set up bulk asphalt facilities at its oil refinery in Bataan, north of Manila, to help meet the rising demand.</p>
<p>-- manila.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
